==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|mittil}} (akin to Old Saxon {{m|osx|middil}}), from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*midilą}}, {{m|gem-pro|*medalą||middle}}, {{m|gem-pro|*midil-}}. Compare Dutch {{m|nl|middel}}, English {{m|en|middle}}. See also {{m|de|Mitte}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈmɪtl̩]|[ˈmɪtəl]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Mittel.ogg|audio|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n||Mittel}}

# [[agent]], [[appliance]]
